---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---
<Section id="about" title="about">
  <div class="max-w-[62ch] space-y-5 text-base/7 text-pretty text-fg-dim">
    <p>
      I'm the <strong class="font-semibold text-fg">Database Coordinator</strong> at{' '}
      <strong class="font-semibold text-fg">Ronald McDonald House Louisville</strong>, where I keep
      the donor database accurate and the reports consistent. Most of the job is finding out why
      two numbers disagree; the best part is replacing the manual process behind them with
      something that runs on its own.
    </p>
    <p class="border-y border-line py-4 text-lg/7 font-medium text-fg">
      The honest answer to “is this an Excel problem or a code problem?” is usually:
      both, in that order.
    </p>
    <p>
      My path here wasn't a straight line. I grew up in a small town, taught myself
      technology, and worked across sales and operations before landing in data. In 2025 I
      graduated with a degree in Interdisciplinary Studies in Business and certificates in Applied Data
      Analytics and Organizational Leadership. That mix is why I build for the people who'll
      actually use the tool, not just for the data.
    </p>
    <p>
      My capstone looked at how engagement-driven algorithms shape what we see and how we feel,
      and it left me convinced technology should serve people rather than steer them.
      Longer term, I want to bring technology, education and resources to places like my
      hometown that usually get overlooked, and help close the digital divide.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
